{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-70747-r4522821","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Swedish Meatballs II","sourcePageId":70747,"sourceRevision":"4522821","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-07-11T19:58:53Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Swedish%20Meatballs%20II&oldid=4522821","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T16:17:52.726Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Duplicate recipes","Category:Main course recipes","Category:Medium Difficulty recipes","Category:Pan fried recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for gravy","Category:Recipes using bread crumb","Category:Recipes using butter","Category:Recipes using ginger","Category:Recipes using ground beef","Category:Recipes using ground pork","Category:Recipes using instant coffee","Category:Recipes using milk","Category:Recipes using wheat flour","Category:Recipes without cooking time","Category:Recipes without servings","Category:Swedish recipes"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"6cc4aaf34c925d51aa272cf7dd6c76748c78e7b0dc15a458a8492af86efbaef1","sourceWikitext":"{{Recipe summary\n| Category = Meat recipes\n| Difficulty = 3\n}}\n\n{{recipe}}\n__NOTOC__\n== Ingredients ==\n===Meatballs===\n* ¾ [[Cookbook:Pound|lb]] ground [[Cookbook:Beef|beef]]\n* ½ lb ground [[Cookbook:Veal|veal]]\n* ¼ lb ground [[Cookbook:Pork|pork]]\n* 1½ [[Cookbook:Cup|cups]] [[Cookbook:Bread Crumb|bread crumbs]]\n* ¼ cup [[Cookbook:Milk|milk]]\n* ½ cup [[Cookbook:Chopping|chopped]] [[Cookbook:Onion|onion]]\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tbsp]] [[Cookbook:Butter|butter]]\n* 1 cup [[Cookbook:Half and Half|half-and-half]]\n* ¼ cup [[Cookbook:Parsley|parsley]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|tsp]] [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n* ¼ cup [[Cookbook:Ginger|ginger]]\n* Black [[Cookbook:Pepper|pepper]]\n===Gravy===\n* 1 tbsp [[Cookbook:Flour|flour]]\n* ¾ cup [[Cookbook:Half and Half|half-and-half]]\n* 2 tbsp [[Cookbook:Butter|butter]]\n* 1 tsp instant [[Cookbook:Coffee|coffee]] (can be omitted or sliced mushrooms can be used instead)\n\n== Procedure ==\n\n=== Meatballs ===\n# Combine the ground beef, veal, and pork.\n# Soak breadcrumbs in milk.\n# Cook onion in butter until tender.\n# Combine meat, soaked bread crumbs, cooked onion, half-and-half, parsley, salt, ginger, and pepper.\n# Shape the mixture into meatballs, about 1 inch in diameter.\n# Very lightly brown the meatballs in a pan over medium heat. Remove meatballs from the pan, and reserve.\n\n=== Gravy ===\n# After lightly browning meatballs, stir the flour into the meatball drippings in the pan, then add the half-and-half, butter, and coffee. Heat and stir until thickened.\n# Either add meatballs and gravy to a [[Cookbook:Slow Cooker|slow cooker]] and [[Cookbook:Simmering|simmer]] until ready to eat, or add meatballs to sauce in pan and simmer for 10 minutes.\n# Serve hot.\n\n[[Category:Swedish recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using ground beef]]\n[[Category:Recipes for gravy]]\n[[Category:Pan fried recipes]]\n[[Category:Main course recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using ground pork]]\n[[Category:Duplicate recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using butter]]\n[[Category:Recipes using bread crumb]]\n[[Category:Recipes using instant coffee]]\n[[Category:Recipes using wheat flour]]\n[[Category:Recipes using ginger]]\n[[Category:Recipes using milk]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Swedish Meatballs II","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"¾ lb ground beef","sourceText":"¾ lb ground beef","amountText":"¾ lb ground beef","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"½ lb ground veal","sourceText":"½ lb ground veal","amountText":"½ lb ground veal","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"¼ lb ground pork","sourceText":"¼ lb ground pork","amountText":"¼ lb ground pork","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"1½ cups bread crumbs","sourceText":"1½ cups bread crumbs","amountText":"1½ cups bread crumbs","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"¼ cup milk","sourceText":"¼ cup milk","amountText":"¼ cup milk","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"½ cup chopped onion","sourceText":"½ cup chopped onion","amountText":"½ cup chopped onion","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-7","name":"2 tbsp butter","sourceText":"2 tbsp butter","amountText":"2 tbsp butter","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-8","name":"1 cup half-and-half","sourceText":"1 cup half-and-half","amountText":"1 cup half-and-half","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-9","name":"¼ cup parsley","sourceText":"¼ cup parsley","amountText":"¼ cup parsley","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-10","name":"1 tsp salt","sourceText":"1 tsp salt","amountText":"1 tsp salt","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-11","name":"¼ cup ginger","sourceText":"¼ cup ginger","amountText":"¼ cup ginger","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-12","name":"Black pepper","sourceText":"Black pepper","amountText":"Black pepper","amount":null,"unit":null,"foo